just a greater likelihood of losing somebody along the way. With less information, people do understand more. So you want to avoid cognitive overload. The other part of making numbers more manageable is do the math for people. We often give people information where they have to do a little bit of math and you lose so many people along the way. Another thing would be to make numbers more meaningful, you can provide context like we talked about this a little bit before too.
人们在过程中迷失的可能性就越大。信息越少，人们理解得越多。所以你要避免认知过载。让数字更易于管理的另一部分是：替人们做数学题。我们经常给人们提供需要他们自己做一点数学运算的信息，结果你在过程中会失去很多人。另一件事是让数字更有意义，你可以提供背景信息，就像我们之前稍微讨论过的那样。

